Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:22:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] avformat/http: reuse a connection only for the host it is
 connected to

Fixes: sending credentials to another host
Fixes: q0uD8AyJRreA
Regression since: e03b034e45
Credential disclosure Replicated through UnModified FFmpeg with a local HTTP server

Found-by: mxyoor
(cherry picked from commit b66d2aca0fc1b6d23c685c21ecbbca3ad8b32c79)
---
 libavformat/http.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavformat/http.c b/libavformat/http.c
index b4e33843e8..5c48787d03 100644
--- a/libavformat/http.c
+++ b/libavformat/http.c
@@ -330,6 +330,9 @@ static int http_open_cnx_internal(URLContext *h, AVDictionary **options)
 
     ff_url_join(buf, sizeof(buf), lower_proto, NULL, hostname, port, NULL);
 
+    if (s->hd && strcmp(s->hd->filename, buf))
+        ffurl_closep(&s->hd);
+
     if (!s->hd) {
         s->nb_connections++;
         err = ffurl_open_whitelist(&s->hd, buf, AVIO_FLAG_READ_WRITE,
